# Rebuild of the default full-NixOS console baseline from master, which
# carries 90ea051 "recovery: validate hashed Stage2 store paths".
#
# The 2026-09-03 flash of f20bdfbc (built from codex/baseline-token-fix-20260902
# at 4bf39104) booted correctly and then refused to self-accept every 2s for the
# full 720s lease with reason=expected-system-invalid.  Its shipped script tested
#   case "$expected_system" in "/nix/store/nixos-system-gemini-mainline-nixos-"*)
# which can never match a real store path, because every store path carries a
# 32-character hash between /nix/store/ and the name.  The image could not accept
# itself under any circumstances.  Master replaces that test with
# valid_system_path(), matching /nix/store/*-nixos-system-gemini-mainline-nixos-?*
# and separately validating the hash length and Nix base32 alphabet.
#
# The kernel Image is byte-identical to the previous candidate
# (578f4417c174fa18d96b73f59cbe2ca8cf2692aaa44047f093abf357906d602c), so the only
# delta is the corrected Stage2 closure and its initramfs.  This remains an exact
# p22-only Download-Only transaction.
